          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:11.10.040:block:2",
          "start": 1082
        },
        "quote": "(c) FOTZ shall be entitled to collect, receive, retain and use for the benefit of the Topeka Zoo and Conservation Center all revenues derived from the operations of the Zoo unless explicitly excluded by the terms of the License and Management Agreement dated February 9, 2021, and amendments thereto. (Ord. 20290 § 13, 4-5-21.)",
